WEBVTT

00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:03.040
Twelve hamsters. One tiny island.

00:00:03.550 --> 00:00:04.800
Bump them OUT!

00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:12.368
Watch your step… the floor is falling apart!

00:00:13.367 --> 00:00:15.367
Last hamster rolling WINS.

00:00:18.583 --> 00:00:20.023
Fifty-plus looks.

00:00:21.653 --> 00:00:22.801
Hamster Bounce!
